WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.827 --> 00:00:14.241
There are more humans
trapped in slavery&nbsp;today

00:00:14.241 --> 00:00:16.467
than any other
time in history.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:18.693
It makes you think...

00:00:19.321 --> 00:00:21.401
Why the media,
most of&nbsp;them,

00:00:21.797 --> 00:00:23.602
and also some people
in Hollywood

00:00:23.602 --> 00:00:25.534
do not want to talk
about this?

00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:29.527
More than 1 in 5 victims
of sex trafficking are children.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.794
By some estimates,
4.8 million people

00:00:34.794 --> 00:00:39.960
are trapped&nbsp;or forced into
sexual exploitation globally.

00:00:41.538 --> 00:00:45.906
Ask yourself, 
why don't they want us
to&nbsp;see it?

00:00:45.906 --> 00:00:48.224
What are they hiding?

